/473393325_632248002870730_3006640312548239801_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2KDQG4BkaTYQ7kNvwGG-cMe&_nc_oc=AdrVBqGD5Kz1gkb6m9v38Fjh2Vy-6dWJyT8wfXidpuUFrTdQjfChTALdgDDVbVAyR7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5zosU9pbiTNyiEgxP624Ebq6p7XX1yoU98ASSq1epr_A&oe=6A1C2F86"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_image.png", "id": "622232867635132", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_622232870968465_3205372193996420289_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bVMfylfP2qMQ7kNvwHjfq7R&_nc_oc=Adrd9yyrwIc-brA7QyQc19H1a9qsrsnRxyId5utNrrMM01_GttoBCieFlz5J8UomOVA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6QcNHmu97V4l3szAKIaNRQMGU_Vi6z5XtYVS1mKQtkKQ&oe=6A1C3895"}, "display_name": "SECRET TAG V2", "keywords": ["parkour", "hard", "team", "fun", "brain"], "long_description": "SECRET TAG V2 is an action-packed movement game that takes speed and agility to the next level! With fluid parkour mechanics, wall-running, sliding, and precise air control, players can navigate dynamic environments with style. The game features a thrilling tag-based gameplay where quick reflexes and strategic movement are the keys to victory.\n\nHone your skills in a specially designed practice area, filled with obstacles, ramps, and interactive elements that let you perfect every trick and technique. Whether you're chasing down opponents or making a daring escape, every match is a test of speed, skill, and creativity. Are you fast enough to stay ahead?", "short_description": "SECRET TAG V2 is an adrenaline-packed movement-based game where speed and skill are everything! Master advanced parkour mechanics, smooth slides, and high-speed dashes as you compete in intense tag matches. Train in a dynamic practice area designed to sharpen your reflexes and perfect your movement. Whether you're chasing or escaping, every second counts in this fast-paced experience!"}]